      "text": "The driver's arrival at the pickup is corroborated by the GPS trace: the nearest fix inside the 120-second window around the 19:31:00 arrival mark sits 2.73 m from the pickup point with a reported accuracy of 5 m, well inside the 50 m STANDARD arrival radius and inside the 25 m accuracy filter, so the trip was validly marked arrived and the free-wait clock was validly started under POL-NS-21.",
