      "text": "The driver served the full free wait before cancelling. The trip is on-demand and the record carries no scheduled time, so under POL-NS-21 the 300 s free wait runs from the driver's arrival at 19:31:00; the driver cancelled at 19:37:20, 380 s later and 80 s past the expiry of the free-wait period, so the timing precondition for cancelling as a rider no-show was satisfied.",
