    "explanation": "Both sides agree on the decisive point, and so do I. Under POL-NS-23 (Ryde Dispute Resolution Policy v2.1, s.2.3), a driver may cancel a trip as a rider no-show only if, before cancelling, he has both sent at least one in-app chat message AND placed at least one in-app call. The message limb is met on this record: two driver messages at 19:31:30 and 19:34:10, both delivered and both read (EV-CHAT-05052). The call limb fails: trip record TRP-05052's in_app_calls array is empty and the chat log contains only text entries, with no voice-call entry, and neither the driver's own statement ('I sent 2 messages and waited more than 5 minutes') nor his advocate asserts any call. POL-NS-23's terms are that if either limb is missing the fee is voided — the rider is not charged and there is no driver compensation. I therefore refund in full the 5.00 SGD cancellation fee charged at 19:37:24 (EV-FARE-05052: total_charged 5.00, cancellation_fee 5.00, refund_issued_sgd 0.00, driver_compensation_if_upheld_sgd 5.00, which is now nil). The driver's compliance with arrival (GPS nearest fix 2.73 m from the pickup, inside the 50 m STANDARD radius and inside the 25 m accuracy filter, EV-GPS-05052) and with the 300-second free wait (on-demand trip, wait ran from the 19:31:00 arrival, cancelled 380 s later at 19:37:20, EV-TRIP-05052) is accepted but does not cure the missing call. The rider's 'in the lift with no signal' account is not borne out — she read both driver messages before the cancellation — but the outcome turns on the driver's obligation, not hers. No referral arises: the fee charged is exactly the 5.00 SGD POL-NS-22 sets, so no fee-amount referral; the POL-NS-24 goodwill credit does not attach because the driver did attempt contact; and rider_profile.no_show_cancellations_30d is absent, so POL-NS-25's repeat no-show flag is not engaged. The contested amount is 5.00 SGD, below POL-GEN-22's 10.00 SGD band, with no fraud flags, so this ruling is final under POL-NS-26. The deciding facts rest on artifacts graded COMPLETE at weight 1.0 (trip record, chat log, ledger); the one MISSING artifact (EV-ADVIS-05052-01, traffic advisory, weight 0.0) carries no fact this dispute needs. Confidence 0.95."
